				<description>&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/vAjasaneyam/mAdhyandinam/saMhitA/Rk/vishvAsa-prastutiH/13/06_namo-stu_sarpebhyo.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;०५ नमो अस्तु ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;न᳓मोऽस्तु सर्पे᳓भ्यो ये᳓ के᳓ च पृथिवी᳓म᳓नु। ये᳓ऽ अन्त᳓रिक्षे ये᳓ दिवि᳓ ते᳓भ्यः सर्पे᳓भ्यो न᳓मः ॥६ ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_17/06_ye-do_rochane.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;०६ येऽदो रोचने ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;ये᳙ ऽदो᳓, रोचने᳓ दिवो᳓,&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ये᳓ वा सू᳓र्यस्य रश्मि᳓षु ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ये᳓षाम् अप्सु᳓ स᳓दः कृतं᳓&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ते᳓भ्यः सर्पे᳓भ्यो न᳓मः ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;&#xA;&lt;div class=&#34;js_include&#34; includetitle=&#34;false&#34; newlevelforh1=&#34;2&#34; unfilled url=&#34;https://vishvAsa.github.io/devaH/vedAH_yajuH/taittirIyam/sUtram/ApastambaH/gRhyam/ekAgnikANDam/vishvAsa-prastutiH/2_17/07_yA_iShavo.md&#34;&gt;&#xA;&lt;details open&gt;&lt;summary&gt;&lt;h2&gt;०७ या इषवो ...{Loading}...&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;/summary&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;या᳓ इ᳓षवो यातुधा᳓नानां&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ये᳓ वा व᳓नस्प᳓तीँर् अ᳓नु ।&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ये᳓ वाऽवटे᳓षु+++(→बिलेषु)+++ शे᳓रते&lt;br&gt;&#xA;ते᳓भ्यः सर्पे᳓भ्यो न᳓मः ॥&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;/details&gt;&#xA;&lt;/div&gt;</description>
